  unitName: Poet Elton
  unitId: 30181
  unitNumber: 463
  description: A wandering poet who travelled all around the La Veda Republic. He
    once made a living as a singer at a town bar, and for a time became very popular
    among the people. One theory as to how he became so popular is that one day,
    while walking through the woods, he saved a fairy from being attacked who then
    gave him a secret potion of song in return. This is considered a credible explanation
    due to the magical charm his songs seemed to possess.
  summonDesc: Do you wish to hear me sing?<br>Understand. I will sing for you.
  fusionDesc: I can feel power boiling<br>out from inside my body.<br>Mind if I convey
    this in a song?
